.TH CPU 1.SH NAMEcpu \- measure the processor's speed.SH SYNOPSIS\fBcpu\fR.SH DESCRIPTION\fBcpu\fRruns a timing loop, draws a bar chart of the results and prints theclock rate it measured.  It uses the floating-point module as well as\fBcio\fR.\fRBy F. R. Schmitt, 1989..PPUnder os9exec it draws the chart and then stops on a trap..SH NOTESNeeds Microware's\fBcio\fRand\fBmath\fR.\fR.SH SEE ALSOsieve, savage, dhrystone